ADDITIONAL TERMS FOR LIBRARY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM:

This software is designed for educational institutions and libraries to manage
their book collections, student records, and borrowing systems. The software
includes features for:

- Book catalog management
- Student registration and management
- Book borrowing and return tracking
- Fine calculation and collection
- Offline-first operation with cloud synchronization
- Barcode scanning integration
- Comprehensive reporting

The software is provided free of charge for educational and non-commercial use.
For commercial licensing, please contact the development team.

DISCLAIMER:
This software is provided for library management purposes. Users are responsible
for ensuring compliance with local data protection laws and regulations when
handling student and library data.
